Set them at top level or per account:

```json5
{
  channels: {
    feishu: {
      typingIndicator: false,
      resolveSenderNames: false,
      accounts: {
        main: {
          appId: "cli_xxx",
          appSecret: "xxx",
          typingIndicator: true,
          resolveSenderNames: false,
