      },
    },
  },
}
```

Optional one-time registration on connect:

```json5
{
  channels: {
    irc: {
      nickserv: {
        register: true,
        registerEmail: "bot@example.com",
      },
    },
  },
}
```

Disable `register` after the nick is registered to avoid repeated REGISTER attempts.

