```

This provides the interactive terminal experience similar to pi's native mode.

Since the Pi is just the Gateway (models run in the cloud), use API-based models:

```json
{
  "agents": {
    "defaults": {
      "model": {
        "primary": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
