}
```

OpenAI's API exposes priority processing via `service_tier=priority`. In
OpenClaw, set `agents.defaults.models["openai/<model>"].params.serviceTier` to
pass that field through on direct `openai/*` Responses requests.

```json5
{
  agents: {
